<description>&lt;p&gt;A priest, Patricio Sanchez, was killed when a large crucifix fell on him during a livestreamed Mass at Our Lady of Perpetual Help in Guayaquil. U.S. forces are now operating alongside Ecuadorian troops, redeploying MQ-9 Reaper drones from Africa to support operations in Colombia and Ecuador and conducting anti-drug strikes at sea that seize crews and destroy boats. European and Ecuadorian police cooperation produced 20 arrests in a major drug-trafficking bust, and nightly curfews were imposed across Ecuador from November 1 to 10 under a state of emergency. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNcllSQ2hlV0dKakpFeXlXak9UZ2hKZ19oNFhnODF4ZGNtaVpqQkVlcVZXOGFhVXNfTE5QUV9BMEN5eE9fUi1kQldVajBQR2pmRTJIMXNBdGNWQlU2cFMyajRuajZ0emV1aFlqUWZ4TkhVNmhHUG5lbS1HaF8zZmlxbloxYldNUUN5SHJQQzlGaVBVeThQd1pJMmI4UkNEUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nine.com.au&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOVlFRYjNSeU5GLXVhZk1vX3lydTBKY0lrV1FzRUlzbURhQVBlckNGRENEMENnc29jZnp1NVEzTXBoZUVfQUtEMzVJZ0pnQlpLNnZwWlM0cHNlUkdEN2JPOTV0dFhRb2xhcDdHQXNyZzFUSFM3VlpzQmRVWkl5ZVdEc1FSVHdWZHR6bjA0ZVNCelVNZG9TSGsyY1Q4VXV3X0xoVUhGUDdMZk1iSHZtMlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dimsum Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNUzdPLTcxSkljSXVPajQ0NUtFbWdBWVRKcUNnZHI2eV9VNUNVQlhXTVlSNnpZeDBEWk5HUEU1ZThtbmktMVI2X2ZKdjJwU3FMTDhXUkZJNFcySk14U3dlajV1ZXBjeVNnS1ViWDhmZGQwUGZuWmJDTDU5ZlNCVGx4ZUtYZmtwallNOGNOdkRSMnFfOHFMLW5nOFFib0dkUEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Greek City Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBaYy1ubC0wYWRPQTkxZGxXNU5UNkhuWnh0OTBGak83Y2YzYl83XzRaUVA3WUNOMkpZUzRNQlcyQmZFQy1ycGJvTzdFTWJDRG8?oc=5&quot;